   00739|       # Issue #1085 (D3.5): the self-development floor no longer gates the
   00740|       # release. It is measured and reported red-until-true by
   00741|       # `.github/workflows/self-development-status.yml` on every push to
   00742|       # `main`; a release is cut on CI correctness alone, and the ledger row
   00743|       # it records says honestly what the model authored in it.
